  "changes": [
    {
      "zh": "详情面板「耗时」页新增「开始时刻」列：每个网络阶段除耗时外还显示绝对时钟（毫秒精度），顶部给出整条请求的「起点 → 终点（时段跨度）」——能直接和服务端日志、上下游链路按时间对账（对齐 Fiddler Statistics 的 Timer 表）",
      "en": "Added a \"Start time\" column to the Timings tab: each network phase now shows its absolute clock time (millisecond precision) next to the duration, with the request's overall start → end span on top — so timings can be lined up with server logs and upstream traces (matching Fiddler's Statistics timers)."
    },
    {
      "zh": "「耗时」页说明时段跨度与总耗时的差额：TLS 完成后到客户端真正发出请求之间的间隙不属于任何网络分段，原先这段「消失的时间」看不出来",
      "en": "The Timings tab now explains the gap between the wall-clock span and the summed phases: the pause between the TLS handshake and the client actually sending the request belongs to no phase, and previously looked like missing time."
    },
    {
      "zh": "补齐英文界面遗漏的 5 条中文文案（API 调试「响应 Header」、耗时页的两条对账说明、时长为空时的 body 提示等）",
      "en": "Filled in 5 strings that had no English translation (API debug \"Response Header\", two timing notes, the empty-body hint, and others)."
    },
    {
      "zh": "修复重放请求返回 400：HTTP/2 的 :authority 既不在请求头里、也不随会话落盘，从会话恢复出来的请求重放时会变成「无 Host、无 :authority」的裸请求而被上游网关拒绝（实测网关直接返回 400 alibaba-ga）。现恢复会话、生成重放副本、编辑 URL/请求头后都会补齐 :authority；HTTP/1 且带 Host 的请求保持原样，不会被改成绝对形式",
      "en": "Fixed replays returning 400: HTTP/2's :authority is neither in the headers nor persisted with the session, so flows restored from a session were replayed as bare requests with no Host and no :authority, which upstream gateways reject (observed: a 400 from an alibaba-ga gateway). :authority is now restored when loading a session, when creating a replay copy, and after editing the URL or headers; HTTP/1 requests that already carry a Host header are left untouched and are not rewritten to absolute form."
    },
    {
      "zh": "支持 IPv6 主机的请求：authority 与 URL 统一给 IPv6 地址加方括号（原先会拼成 ::1:8080 这类无法解析的形式）。这同时修复了 IPv6 会话存档后恢复时报错、整份会话打不开的问题，以及 IPv6 请求导出 curl 后无法执行、带入 API 调试页提示 URL 非法的问题",
      "en": "Added IPv6 host support: authority and URLs now bracket IPv6 literals (previously assembled as unparseable values such as ::1:8080). This also fixes sessions containing IPv6 requests failing to load at all, exported curl commands for IPv6 requests being unrunnable, and sending such requests to the API debug page reporting an invalid URL."
    },
    {
      "zh": "导出 HAR 补上 Host 请求头：HTTP/2 的 :authority 是伪头、不在请求头列表里，此前导出的 HAR 会缺 Host（HAR 1.2 要求 request.headers 含 Host），导入到其他工具时可能丢失主机信息",
      "en": "HAR export now includes the Host request header: HTTP/2's :authority is a pseudo-header and not part of the header list, so exported HAR files were missing Host (HAR 1.2 expects request.headers to contain it) and could lose the host when imported into other tools."
    },
    {
      "zh": "会话恢复容错：单条记录重建失败时只跳过该条并计入「已跳过」，不再因为一条坏记录导致整份会话加载失败",
      "en": "More resilient session loading: if a single record cannot be rebuilt, only that record is skipped and counted, instead of the whole session failing to load because of one bad record."
    },
    {
