      "en": "New Settings page (menu \"Settings → Preferences…\", shortcut Ctrl+,): ports (proxy/certificate), save limit, list order, auto-scroll, Body wrapping, system proxy takeover, theme, language, auto-save on quit and update check — switches previously scattered across the toolbar and menus, now in one place and synced with the toolbar on OK."
