    {
      "zh": "端口输入框防误改（无微调按钮、屏蔽滚轮）从工具栏抽出为公共组件，设置页同款复用",
      "en": "The port input's mis-click protection (no spin buttons, wheel events dropped) is now a shared component reused by both the toolbar and the Settings page."
