      "zh": "修复「在工具页中打开 body」选择后无可见变化：工具页停在 API 调试子页时自动改投 JSON/编码转换子页（JSON 进 JSON 工具，否则进编码转换），空 body 给出更明确的提示",
      "en": "Fixed \"Open body in Tools\" appearing to do nothing: when the Tools page is on the API debug tab, the body is now routed to the JSON tool (for JSON) or the codec tool (otherwise), and an empty body shows a clearer hint."
