      "zh": "详情面板默认显示「响应」页（抓包场景优先看响应）；用户手动切换页签后，当次运行内记住该选择，下次启动回到默认响应页",
      "en": "The detail panel now defaults to the \"Response\" tab (since packet capture focuses on responses); once you manually switch tabs, the choice sticks for the rest of the session, and a fresh launch returns to the default Response tab."
